# Generated, stateful or refetchable. None of it belongs in history.
#
# The pipeline's own README explains why the cache lives in ~/Library/Caches
# rather than here: it is refetchable, not work product. The same reasoning
# applies to everything below — 11 MB of resolver state, run logs and per-season
# output that a re-run reproduces.
*.json
*.log
*.txt
*.pre-consolidate
_state/
# ...except geo25.json, which is not any of those things. It is the reference
# table that turns a hometown string into a nationality — the authority behind
# every country claim the Evidence layer makes. L6C's blanket *.json rule
# swallowed it, and L6D found out by discovering the versioned pipeline could
# not import lib.py at all. Reference data, not state: it belongs in history.
!geo25.json
